  "description": "Prevents two editors from changing the same Umbraco content node at the same time. When a node is already open, a second editor gets a read-only view with a red border and can Request access (the holder is prompted to accept) or Force access (immediate takeover). Real-time over SignalR. Umbraco 17+.",
